# DEMO: root matching (Watson & Arrillaga chapter 5)
#
# The circuit of demo_chatter, with the 1 ohm and 1 mH as one series R-L branch (element LOAD). With
# the trapezoidal rule the branch voltage (node 2) flips +-187 V at every step after the switch
# opens at 3 ms. Root matching replaces the branch's difference equation by the exact exponential
# one, i(t) = exp(-R dt / L) i(t - dt) + (1 - exp(-R dt / L)) / R v(t), which has no memory of the
# voltage and so cannot chatter.
#
# Chatter removal and interpolation are OFF in this file. In the editor:
#   1. Run, and look at V2 (and the current in LOAD).
#   2. Tick "Hold run".
#   3. Under Run settings, set Chatter removal to "root matching of R-L branches, with detection"; Run.
# No chatter, and the current rise before 3 ms is also closer to exact (it is exact for a step).
# Root matching applies only to R-L branches (RL, RL3, line and source impedances, transformers,
# machines); separate L and C elements keep the trapezoidal rule, with the CDA half steps after
# switchings and wherever chatter is detected (as chatter=detect).
# Command line: run.bat circuits\demo_rootmatch.net --chatter=rootmatch
#
# Generated by circuits/make_drawings.py; open it in the circuit editor (gui.bat) to see the drawing.
#
# EMTSim netlist: demo: root matching of an R-L branch (drawn with the EMTSim circuit editor)
#
# Format: R/L/C from to value | V from to peak angle freq [R] | SW from to closed|open times... | F from to t_apply [t_clear]
# 2 nodes, 3 elements

.tran 0.0001 0.005

.options chatter=off interp=off

V 0 1  10 0 0   # BATTERY
SW 1 2  closed 0.003   # SWITCH
RL 2 0  1 0.001   # LOAD

#@layout {"v":1,"components":[{"type":"V","name":"BATTERY","x":0,"y":8,"rot":0,"params":{"mag":"10","angle":"0","freq":"0","r":"","l":""}},{"type":"GND","name":"GND","x":0,"y":8,"rot":0,"params":{}},{"type":"SW","name":"SWITCH","x":6,"y":8,"rot":0,"params":{"state":"closed","times":"0.003","opens":"at the time"}},{"type":"RL","name":"LOAD","x":14,"y":8,"rot":90,"params":{"r":"1","l":"1m"}},{"type":"GND","name":"GND","x":14,"y":12,"rot":0,"params":{}}],"wires":[{"x1":4,"y1":8,"x2":6,"y2":8},{"x1":10,"y1":8,"x2":14,"y2":8}],"settings":{"dt":"100u","tstop":"5m","chatter":"off","interp":"off"}}
